<title>UK: NIB sets 2.0 billion Lux franc December 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>NIB sets 2.0 billion Lux franc December 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Generale du Luxembourg and Generale Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDIC INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FLUX  COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    29.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.70    PAY DATE  L-29.NOV.96</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 FULL FEES   1.75</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  SUPRA     YIELD	 5.28 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
